{
  "_doc": "Where every game sound comes from. scripts/sounds.py fetches each source, cuts candidate clips for its slot, and the sound lab (audio-lab/) is where they get auditioned and picked. cut: 'events' splits a short sound-effect video at its silences; 'windows' takes the best-sounding stretches of a long recording at the slot's length. section limits the download of long videos.",
